From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tom Englund <tomenglund26@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 14:11:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] nvkms: don't wait for the post-flip IMP update under
 nvkms_lock

TryToDoPostFlipIMP() lowers the usage bounds and re-enables the mid-frame
and DWCF watermark once flips no longer need them, and waited for that
core channel update with nvDoIMPUpdateEvo(). With an IMP change the
update takes a display supervisor round trip through RM, 10-15 ms, all of
it under nvkms_lock, which stalls every client's flips.

Kick the update off without waiting for it. Lowering only happens on
channels without pending methods, and a flip that needs the higher usage
bounds or the watermark disabled again goes through PreFlipIMP(), whose
synchronous core channel update completes after this one, so no flip can
run against bounds it exceeds.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-hw-flip.c | 13 ++++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-hw-flip.c b/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-hw-flip.c
index f66e4924..590fb861 100644
--- a/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-hw-flip.c
+++ b/src/nvidia-modeset/src/nvkms-hw-flip.c
@@ -3139,7 +3139,18 @@ TryToDoPostFlipIMP(void *dataPtr, NvU32 dataU32)
         }
 
         if (update) {
-            nvDoIMPUpdateEvo(pDispEvo, &updateState);
+            /*
+             * Don't wait for the update to complete: with an IMP change that
+             * takes a display supervisor round trip through RM, 10-15 ms,
+             * all of it under nvkms_lock, which stalls every client's flips.
+             * Lowering only happens on channels without pending methods,
+             * and a flip that needs the higher usage bounds or the
+             * watermark disabled again goes through PreFlipIMP(), whose
+             * synchronous core channel update completes after this one, so
+             * no flip can run against bounds it exceeds.
+             */
+            nvEvoUpdateAndKickOff(pDispEvo, FALSE /* sync */, &updateState,
+                                  TRUE /* releaseElv */);
         }
     }
 }
